sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant API as DOS Cloud API
    participant Catalog as Catalog Packages
    participant Drive as User C: Drive
    participant DB as Metadata DB
    participant DOS as DOSBox Runtime

    User->>UI: Install game
    UI->>API: POST install
    API->>Catalog: Read verified package
    API->>Drive: Extract into C:\GAMES\...
    API->>DB: Record installation
    API-->>UI: Installed

    User->>UI: Play
    UI->>API: POST launch
    API->>DB: Verify user + install
    API->>DB: Create launch session
    API-->>UI: Session ID
    UI->>DOS: Open new runtime tab
    DOS->>API: Load launch config
    DOS->>API: Filesystem RPC
    API->>Drive: Read/write user files
